# Cursor Rules for Xala Digdir Monorepo

## Core Rules
- Follow AI_RULES.md strictly
- Apps must NOT import @digdir/* packages directly
- Import @xala/ds/styles exactly once in main.tsx
- No custom UI components in apps - use only @xala/ds exports
- Use DesignsystemetProvider for theme switching
- Follow asChild pattern: only one child allowed
- Use data attributes: data-color-scheme, data-size, data-typography

## Architecture
- pnpm workspaces with Turborepo
- Vite + React + TypeScript for web
- Fastify for API
- ESLint guardrails enforce import restrictions

## Theme Support
- Themes: digdir, altinn, uutilsynet, portal
- Runtime theme switching via provider
- Single CSS import rule strictly enforced
